<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <svg width={1280} height={720} viewBox='0 0 1280 720' style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, opacity: 0.18 }}>
        <path d='M800 500 Q 950 200 1100 320 T 1260 240' fill='none' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='3' />
        <circle cx='1100' cy='320' r='16' fill='#FFC107' />
        <circle cx='960' cy='300' r='10' fill='#8FC0F0' />
        <path d='M800 560 H 1260' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='2' />
        <path d='M1090 330 L 1080 400 M1100 336 L 1100 400 M1110 330 L 1120 400' stroke='#8FC0F0' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='1100' y='430' fill='#8FC0F0' font-size='24' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>min L</text>
    </svg>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', paddingTop: 84, paddingLeft: 72, paddingRight: 72, paddingBottom: 72, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 40 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 200, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9', lineHeight: 1 }}>
                05
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 150, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.35)' }} />
            <Box style={{ gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 50, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 3 }}>
                    损失函数与优化策略
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', fontSize: 21, color: '#8FC0F0', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                    Loss Functions and Optimization
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#CFE0F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    损失函数定义了"什么算错"，优化器决定了"怎么改"。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>交叉熵</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    Softmax 把 logits 变成概率，交叉熵惩罚"给真实类别的概率不够高"。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>类别加权</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    少数类的错误乘上更大权重，直接把"临床偏好"写进损失。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.10)', border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>平滑与调度</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DCE8F7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    标签平滑防过拟合，AdamW 解耦权重衰减，StepLR 分段降学习率。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
